{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_10_level_main_10-09_end",
  "groupId": "main_10",
  "stageId": "main_10-09",
  "title": "旧日之影",
  "storyCode": "10-10",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6b377a8580c03c85f40055a215c7b463d333ac3651362ee7e15f7bc5a3a616b1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "能让你露出这么惊讶的表情，我多少有些意外。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "毕竟，我给过你提示了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......你该不会是说那颗石子吧？这种不合时宜的念旧笑话让我一点都笑不出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我还以为......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "你以为来的会是谁？曼弗雷德吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......我是在想，特雷西斯会留你一命，还让你在伦蒂尼姆四处蹦跶，他是不是也老糊涂了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "看你们这么长时间没有声音，我还当你们早就死透了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "喔......是我想当然了。你看，你说得没错，我确实变得......太多愁善感，以至于一时忘记了，我们都不过是雇佣兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "你引爆炸弹的速度变慢了，W。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "而你这次手没有发抖呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "你从整合运动带走的那些雇佣兵呢？难道你真是一个人来的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "带他们来，然后让他们跟你一样，被摄政王收买，反过来给我一堆惊喜吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......你很为他们着想。难怪，我没有看到更多熟悉的面孔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我就不一样了，在伦蒂尼姆，我可是见到了很多老熟人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "你还是老样子，真的很爱从我手下挖人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "让我猜一猜，施瓦布果然已经死了吧？是你亲手杀了他吗，赫德雷？那家伙认识你，比认识我还要久，没错吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "杀死一个曾经背着你走了一天一夜，躲过了十几个特雷西斯派来的杀手的老朋友，你握剑的手有没有抖？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "你记错了。护卫罗德岛号的时候，他已经离队了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "好吧，关于这些一起打过仗的人，你的记性一向比我好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我早就想问了，记住这些死掉的人，会让你更安心一些吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我猜并不会，赫德雷，你的表情告诉我，你最近做的噩梦比当年加起来还要多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "W，我认识你的时间和你认识我的时间一样长。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "当你试图变换角度挑起我的情绪的时候，你只不过是想掩饰你自己内心的波动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "喔，你又知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "换作以前的你，一定会毫不犹豫地把那几个拖后腿的反抗军抓过来，当作送给我们的活饵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "要是有人告诉我，W自愿留下殿后——我一定会告诉他，这个笑话一点都不好笑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "在切尔诺伯格核心城的那段经历让你彻底疯了吗，W？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "是塔露拉烧坏了你的大脑，还是你自己出现了一些不该出现的幻觉，在某个人身上看到了死去已久的影子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "疯子不会承认自己疯了的，是吧？你怎么知道，疯了的人是我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "特雷西斯的信任没那么廉价。施瓦布的脑袋远远不够格。你还加了多少码？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "呃，你该不会是把她......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "别说这样的话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "喔......反应这么大？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "我们已经做到了所有能做到的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "W，是你耽搁得太久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我没听错吧，你是想为自己的无能找借口？那时候是谁跟我说自己都打算好了的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "你以为，我是在什么时候失去了一只眼睛？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "等等，你是说，伊内丝她......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "是的，她死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "......又来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "我才不......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "雇佣兵会为失信付出代价，而我已经付出了我的代价。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "我们出来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗本",
      "text": "是啊，我们这一路上运气是不是有点好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗本",
      "text": "萨卡兹士兵都被南边的爆炸吸引过去了，在审讯室附近看守的那几个还被深池提前干掉了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "......在战场上相信运气的人一般都不会有什么好下场。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "呵，要不是莫名其妙的好运气，你怎么可能活到现在？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被俘的士兵",
      "text": "呃......她是谁？他们几个也是从审讯室逃出来的？是......是友军？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "......是敌人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "（瞄准。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "（但是......先不要开火。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "你每次见我的时候都要举着弩吗，士兵？别以为我不知道，你们刚才可是一路跟着我们，才顺利地走到这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "......你想听我感谢你？那你得跟我去伦蒂尼姆最深的监狱里走一趟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "说实话，我都快有些佩服你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "你跟其他那些满身肥油，只配被倒在下水道里冲走的贵族不太一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "为了保住以前那种生活，他们可以跪倒在任何人脚下。萨卡兹......或者深池，对他们来说并没有差别。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "而你......你就是不肯放弃，你就跟最讨厌的飞虫一样，不管我走到哪里，你都会冒出来碍我的眼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "在碍眼这一点上，彼此彼此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "你......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "咳咳......咳咳咳......蔓、蔓德拉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "你这位朋友伤得可不轻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "你身边那些士兵也没好到哪里去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "看来我们都需要赶时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "真可惜，今天我没工夫与你纠缠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "那挺好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "麻烦让道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "......我们走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "对了，士兵——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "在我的石头刺穿你之前......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "你最好不要死在萨卡兹手上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗本",
      "text": "呼......号角，他们真的又走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "......正好，我们还得把弹药留给萨卡兹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗本",
      "text": "你是说......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "你不也觉得我们的行动顺利过头了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "无论深池从审讯室里带走的是谁，我都不觉得萨卡兹会那么容易地放过他们——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "text": "——以及我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "海蒂女士，你们的人都撤出来了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海蒂",
      "text": "是的，阿米娅，大家都在这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "海蒂女士，让体弱的人走在最前面，我们会处理掉追上来的雇佣兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "费斯特先生，你们还能战斗吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "text": "当然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费斯特",
      "text": "老比尔，抓紧点好吗？待会动起手来可能会有些晃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "text": "各位，前面也有敌人！应该是从另一个入口处过来的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "text": "发现目标！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹战士",
      "text": "快，快过来，干掉他们！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "text": "嘿，可别跑得比我们还快。走路不看后面的话，也会摔跤的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "达格达",
      "text": "还漏了几个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "text": "你不是还没打过瘾吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "text": "去吧，先干掉那个术师。万一他往我们的伤员身上扔点什么法术，就很难办了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "太好了，摩根，达格达，你们回来了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "text": "阿米娅，博士，我们来得不算太晚吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "正好。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我放心了。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "text": "呼......倒是你，博士，你可没跟我说，来接应我们的只有一个人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "一个人够了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "摩根",
              "text": "你知道吗，博士，越是了解罗德岛，我就越觉得罗德岛神秘......",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "摩根",
              "text": "当然，不管我见到多少神奇的干员，最神秘的人一定是你呀。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "其实不止一个。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "摩根",
              "text": "果然......你一定会留后手的，是吧？",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "摩根",
              "text": "在这一点上，我们是一样的人呢。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "text": "对了，萨卡兹士兵看起来是被引到这边了，但我们这一路上也没看到太多人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "text": "在里面替我们拖着敌人的那几位朋友......要不是特别厉害的话，一定会很危险。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "其实，我有些担心W小姐......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "text": "W？你是说那个很多去过切尔诺伯格的干员念念不忘的W吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "呃，是她。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "text": "......罗德岛上还真是人才济济啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "我们......暂时是合作伙伴。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "博士，她说有事要找海蒂女士的时候，她的眼神不太对劲。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你感觉到了什么，阿米娅？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "她不是一直那副样子吗？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "她的情绪......是比一般人特殊一些。但她在有些时候并没有刻意伪装，在那些时刻，她的眼神骗不了人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "上一次她露出那种眼神，还是在她嘶吼着问我要停下核心城的密钥的时候。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "她......她是不是还有什么别的话没说出来？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "等她回来，你可以问问她。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "她可是W。她一定还会回来。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "好的......这一次，我也愿意相信她。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "嘶......哈......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "你流了很多血。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "你身上也破了好几个洞。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "你该和过去一样，在身上多藏一颗炸弹的。那样的话，你至少有一次与我同归于尽的机会。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "咳咳......赫德雷。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "我的人头值多少钱？够你在伦蒂尼姆买一座小房子吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "抱歉，W。摄政王不会记住像你这样的雇佣兵的名字。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "哈......你也是这么对伊内丝说的吗？在她为你们俩的小小梦想掉脑袋之前？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "都这种时候了，你还是这么嘴硬。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "不然呢？为你们俩的愚蠢大笑两声外加鼓鼓掌吗？你别指望在我脸上找到一点伤心的痕迹，赫德雷，那太不像我了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "......愚蠢的人到底是谁？倒在这里的人是你不是我。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "都说过了，我只是......嗯，有一点小小的惊讶。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "惊讶到错过三四次炸断我手脚的机会？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "这才真的不像你，W。是什么让你乱了阵脚？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "喔，本来以为死了的老朋友原地复活，还想着捅我几剑，这还不够吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "这句话听着倒没那么假。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "W，你说的这位老朋友......到底是谁？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "我就是......讨厌你这一点。你和她一样，总以为能看穿我。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "很可惜，这一次我依然没判断错。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "你潜入伦蒂尼姆有一段时间了，会让你如此心神恍惚的人和事还没那么多。你究竟在城内看到了什么，W？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "......是你跟着特雷西斯，不是我。难道你跪在他的假王座面前的次数还不够多，以至于你还没来得及看清楚他耍的把戏？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "你确实知道了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "别再跟我玩什么你知道我知道什么的猜谜游戏了。拿出点雇佣兵的样子吧，赫德雷。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "我不能让你活着离开这里，W。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "在我杀死的这么多熟人中，我相信......你会是最能理解我的选择的那一个。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "......到底是谁变得更优柔寡断了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "我就是要狠狠瞪着你，看清楚是哪个萨卡兹敢把剑捅进我的心脏。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "......好。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "再见了，W。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "......唔？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "我的剑......被挡下了？那是......匕首？从哪里飞过来的匕首？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "......别动。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "............",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "好久不见，阿斯卡纶。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "你......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
          "text": "你也别动。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "咳咳，要不然呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "......等等，你是来救我的，我没有理解错吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "不会吧，你总不能是想帮他？难道你不知道特雷西斯对她做了什么——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "你是不是最好扔得更用心一些？我这会可是重伤，差一点就躲不开了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
          "text": "......那倒是挺可惜。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "你知道你杀不掉我了，对吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "你当过我的头儿，我也当过你的头儿，可是这里有一个人，她当过我们俩的头儿。而且现在，她明显心情不是很好。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "......我知道。我们俩的人头在下一刻都可能落地。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫德雷",
          "text": "所以......我无话可说。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
          "text": "......W。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡纶",
          "text": "你每多说一句话，血就会流得更快一些。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "我知道啦，多谢关心。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "text": "看起来......如果不想一起死在这里的话，你就得忍受这一次小小的失败了，赫德雷“队长”。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
